  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: Multiple unidentified infant remains were recovered from the affected location.
    During transportation, the bodies appeared to merge into a single mass through
    an unknown biological process. Recovery personnel reported abnormal movement
    despite the absence of any detectable vital signs. The surrounding environment
    showed rapid fungal growth with no identifiable source. Further investigation
    was suspended following the disappearance of two members of the recovery team.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
