  m_text: 'Appearance - A humanoid entity with unnaturally pale skin and an emaciated
    body. Long black hair obscures most of its face. Its mouth is torn wide into
    a permanent smile reaching both cheeks, while its enlarged eyes remain fixed
    on anyone within sight. It is always dressed in a worn patient gown.

'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
