  m_text: The subject is believed to have been one of the patients reported missing
    shortly before the hospital's closure. Medical records recovered from the facility
    contained repeated references to severe hallucinations and persistent fear of
    cameras. Surveillance footage from the final night shows the subject wandering
    the corridors alone before abruptly disappearing from view. The body was never
    recovered, and all remaining records regarding the incident have been partially
    destroyed. The exact circumstances surrounding the transformation remain unknown.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a93a01eafd23a3c4b90d2214c67babc5, type: 2}
