  m_text: The subject is believed to have been an ordinary visitor prior to the incident.
    Witnesses reported hearing loud laughter echoing throughout the playground moments
    before all communication was lost. No signs of physical struggle were discovered
    within the area, despite severe structural damage surrounding the scene. Security
    footage captured only brief silhouettes before the recording abruptly terminated.
    The exact circumstances surrounding the subject's transformation remain unknown.
